Then I'll be happy.

929
01:06:32.905 --> 01:06:34.990
Lots of money
and lots of stuff.

930
01:06:35.074 --> 01:06:38.118
Other people want idiotic
crap like getting married
or having babies

931
01:06:38.202 --> 01:06:40.036
with the man that
they've loved for five years.

932
01:06:40.121 --> 01:06:43.248
But not me, Bruce.
Just give me the boat.

933
01:06:43.332 --> 01:06:45.000
No wonder you stayed single!

934
01:06:45.084 --> 01:06:48.670
Oh! Grace, don't do this!
I'm not doing this.

935
01:06:48.754 --> 01:06:50.672
I'm undoing it.
I'll be at Debbie's.

936
01:06:50.756 --> 01:06:52.590
You take care of Sam
until I can make arrangements.

937
01:06:55.928 --> 01:06:57.887
You can't leave me.

938
01:06:59.432 --> 01:07:03.977
I'm the alpha, lady!
I'm the omega, baby!

939
01:07:05.146 --> 01:07:07.564
Okay, fine. I don't need you.

940
01:07:13.779 --> 01:07:18.241
What's the matter, Bruce?
