984
01:10:27.306 --> 01:10:29.182
We don't eat that.
Oh, that's not food.

985
01:10:29.266 --> 01:10:33.937
Go to the bathroom, please.
Wash out your mouth.
Wash off your hands.

986
01:10:34.021 --> 01:10:36.689
God, I swear that kid
is gonna poop an ornament.

987
01:10:36.774 --> 01:10:39.984
One more time,
you're gonna be
in a lot of trouble.

988
01:10:40.986 --> 01:10:43.446
All right.
That's it! That's it!

989
01:10:44.281 --> 01:10:45.657
Hi.

990
01:10:46.408 --> 01:10:50.286
I surrender!
I surrender! I surrender.

991
01:10:54.166 --> 01:10:55.667
Hi.
Hi.

992
01:10:59.838 --> 01:11:06.094
I'm doing
my first anchor tonight.
Oh, wow! That's great!

993
01:11:06.178 --> 01:11:07.929
So how have you been doing?
Good.

994
01:11:08.013 --> 01:11:09.847
Yeah?
Yeah. Good.

995
01:11:10.766 --> 01:11:14.686
Just...
Debbie won the lottery.
Oh, yeah? You're kidding.

996
01:11:14.770 --> 01:11:20.275
But I guess so did
400,000 other people,
so she only won, like, $17.

997
01:11:23.737 --> 01:11:25.029
I miss you.

998
01:11:28.784 --> 01:11:30.660
Okay.

999
01:11:30.744 --> 01:11:34.580
