Yeah, I'm drunk.
Drunk with power.

1017
01:12:40.731 --> 01:12:43.900
Love me. Love me.

1018
01:12:44.735 --> 01:12:47.945
Love me. Love me!

1019
01:12:49.823 --> 01:12:51.074
I did.

1020
01:13:03.962 --> 01:13:06.964
Yeah, I know, free will.
Oh, God.

1021
01:13:07.383 --> 01:13:11.844
More power outages
reported today caused by
