1039
01:14:02.855 --> 01:14:05.273
Five seconds to the open.
This is it.

1040
01:14:05.357 --> 01:14:07.316
You ready?
Born that way.

1041
01:14:07.401 --> 01:14:10.570
Welcome to
Eyewitness News at 6:00,
with Susan Ortega,

1042
01:14:11.447 --> 01:14:12.947
Bruce Nolan,

1043
01:14:13.031 --> 01:14:15.908
Fred Donohue, sports,
Dallas Coleman, weather.

1044
01:14:15.993 --> 01:14:18.119
