1061
01:15:02.080 --> 01:15:05.124
In other news... Bloody hell!

1062
01:15:05.250 --> 01:15:07.543
For the love of God,
what is it now?
The whole booth is down.

1063
01:15:07.628 --> 01:15:11.964
