that's a miracle.

1106
01:18:53.478 --> 01:18:55.521
People want me
to do everything for them.

1107
01:18:55.605 --> 01:18:58.941
But what they don't realize
is they have the power.

1108
01:19:00.110 --> 01:19:04.155
You wanna see a miracle, son?
Be the miracle.

1109
01:19:08.326 --> 01:19:10.161
Wait. Are you leaving?

1110
01:19:11.163 --> 01:19:13.998
Yeah. I see that
you can handle things now.

1111
01:19:14.082 --> 01:19:17.168
But what if I need you.
What if I have questions?

1112
01:19:17.252 --> 01:19:21.589
That's your problem, Bruce.
That's everybody's problem.

1113
01:19:21.673 --> 01:19:23.174
You keep looking up.

1114
01:19:27.637 --> 01:19:31.766
Order has been
restored in Buffalo after
this evening's downtown riot.

1115
01:19:31.850 --> 01:19:36.687
State officials have suspended
all lottery sales
pending further investigation.

1116
01:19:36.772 --> 01:19:40.733
No injuries were reported
in the melee, however,
there were dozens...

1117
01:20:19.815 --> 01:20:24.193
I've got to be honest
I think you know

1118
01:20:24.736 --> 01:20:29.198
We're covered in lies
and that's okay

1119
01:20:29.282 --> 01:20:30.324
Okay.

1120
01:20:30.408 --> 01:20:32.368
There's somewhere
beyond this I know

1121
01:20:32.452 --> 01:20:34.495
Well, thanks a million.
Oh, not a problem.

1122
01:20:34.579 --> 01:20:35.788
God bless.

1123
01:20:35.872 --> 01:20:38.415
Hope I can find
the words to say

1124
01:20:39.751 --> 01:20:41.335
Never again, no

1125
01:20:41.419 --> 01:20:45.339
Bruce giveth
and Bruce taketh away.

1126
01:20:45.423 --> 01:20:48.342
If you don't like it,
megabyte me.

1127
01:20:48.426 --> 01:20:53.264
'Cause you're a god
and I am not

1128
01:20:53.348 --> 01:20:56.851
And I just thought
that you would know

1129
