I suppose you're here
to gloat about
the anchor position.

1131
01:21:04.901 --> 01:21:08.779
Go ahead. Take your best shot.
Actually, I...

1132
01:21:10.574 --> 01:21:13.868
I just came to tell you
that I've been a royal prick.

1133
01:21:13.952 --> 01:21:17.496
