in the first place.

1135
01:21:21.960 --> 01:21:23.294
Congratulations.

1136
01:21:23.378 --> 01:21:26.255
'Cause you're a God
and I am not

1137
01:21:26.339 --> 01:21:28.090
Thanks, Bruce.

1138
01:21:28.174 --> 01:21:31.093
In the financial world,
things are settling
back to normal

1139
01:21:31.177 --> 01:21:34.388
