a fluke market fluctuation.

1140
01:21:34.472 --> 01:21:37.224
You made the right move, Jack.
So what about you?

1141
01:21:37.309 --> 01:21:39.435
Are you ready
to go back out there?

1142
01:21:40.353 --> 01:21:43.188
