1156
01:22:30.445 --> 01:22:35.491
'Cause you're a God
and I am not

1157
01:22:35.575 --> 01:22:40.245
And I just thought
that you would know

1158
01:22:40.330 --> 01:22:45.125
You're a God and I am not

1159
